Title:  The growth of firms

Seq:    12.6.125.1.1

Level:  6 - Subdetail

Class:  quote

Attribution: [[Penrose, Edith|Edith Penrose]], 1959, from the book *[[The Theory of the Growth of the Firm]]*

Timestamp: 20251218192020

Date Added: 2025-12-18 12:20:20 -0700

Date Modified: 2026-10-15 12:27:06 -0600

Referenced In: Each group fulfills a purpose

Body:

All the evidence we have indicates that the growth of firms is connected with the attempts of a particular group of human beings to do something.

